<Data>Data Flow Analysis : LTE_DL_Clipping_Analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;8/5/2016..10:47 AM&#x000D;&#x000A;Ambient Temperature[C]=27.000000&#x000D;&#x000A;LTE_DL_Src_RangeCheck &apos;LTE_DL_Clipping__LTE_DL_Src_1.LTE_DL_Src_RangeCheck&apos;: &#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;System Configurations:&#x000D;&#x000A;1. Number of transmit antenna ports is 1.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. Frame structure is FDD.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. Channel bandwidth is 10 MHz.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. Cell ID is 0.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. Normal cyclic prefix is employed.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. Number of OFDM symbols used for transmission of PDCCHs of the 10 downlink subframes are {2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2}.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 1:&#x000D;&#x000A;1.HARQ closed-loop transmission is enabled.&#x000D;&#x000A;The number of HARQ processes is 8. The maximum number of HARQ transmission per each HARQ process is 4.&#x000D;&#x000A;The transport block sizes displayed following indicates the transport block size in each subframe when there is no HARQ retransmission.These values may be different in HARQ retransmission.&#x000D;&#x000A;2. For Codeword  1, transport block sizes of the 10 subframes are {2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555, 2555}.&#x000D;&#x000A;3. For Codeword 1, modulation orders of the 10 subframes are {QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK, QPSK}.&#x000D;&#x000A;4. Number of allocated resource blocks (RBs) of the 10 subframes are {50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50}.&#x000D;&#x000A;5. Number of symbols (resource elements (REs)) available for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {6480, 6900, 6900, 6900, 6900, 6756, 6900, 6900, 6900, 6900}.&#x000D;&#x000A;6. For Codeword 1, number of channel bits for UE 1 of the 10 subframes are {12960, 13800, 13800, 13800, 13800, 13512, 13800, 13800, 13800, 13800}.&#x000D;&#x000A;7. For Codeword  1, code rates of the 10 subframes are {0.1971, 0.1851, 0.1851, 0.1851, 0.1851, 0.1891, 0.1851, 0.1851, 0.1851, 0.1851}.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 2:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 3:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 4:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 5:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A; &#x000D;&#x000A;For UE 6:No resource blocks (RBs) are allocated.&#x000D;&#x000A;Execution time: 23.396 sec&#x000D;&#x000A;</Data></Item>
