<Text>&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Rx Algorithm Parameters %&#x000D;&#x000A;PreDownsampling = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;Fmax = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% calculate the sampling rate&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingTable = [1.92 3.84 7.68 15.36 23.04 30.72];&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingFreq = 1e6 * SamplingTable(Bandwidth+1);&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplingRate = SamplingFreq * (2^OversamplingOption);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;RS_EPRE=-42.247198959355486851297334733878 ;&#x000D;&#x000A;NDensity_dBm=RS_EPRE-10*log10(15e3)-SNR;&#x000D;&#x000A;NDensity=10^(NDensity_dBm/10)/1000;</Text>
