<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>BandwidthTable = [128 256 512 1024 1536 2048];&#x000D;&#x000A;N_RB_Table = [6 15 25 50 75 100];&#x000D;&#x000A;NumOfRBs = N_RB_Table(Bandwidth+1);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;UsedCarriers=12*NumOfRBs;&#x000D;&#x000A;Base_DFTSize = BandwidthTable(Bandwidth+1);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;DFTSize=Base_DFTSize*(2^OversamplingOption);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;DFT_zeros =DFTSize-UsedCarriers-1;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Half_UsedCarriers1=UsedCarriers/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Half_UsedCarriers2=UsedCarriers/2;</Text>
